{"id":"641092","name":"大蒜腌小黄瓜","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/641092/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"小黄瓜","amount":"4斤"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"600g"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"我50g"},{"name":"青辣椒","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"小黄瓜。","img":"images/641092/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗净，晾一天，去去水分。","img":"images/641092/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切段，放食盐腌制。","img":"images/641092/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"大蒜去皮洗净晾干水分。","img":"images/641092/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"大蒜拍碎。","img":"images/641092/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"姜和青辣椒切条。","img":"images/641092/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅烧干，放生抽。","img":"images/641092/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮开锅，放一边凉透。","img":"images/641092/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/641092/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"油热放花椒爆香关火。","img":"images/641092/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"生抽凉透放大蒜等。","img":"images/641092/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放食盐和鸡精。","img":"images/641092/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放白糖，拌匀。","img":"images/641092/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"腌了几小时的黄瓜。","img":"images/641092/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"撰一下水分。","img":"images/641092/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放大蒜里。","img":"images/641092/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/641092/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"倒上爆香的花椒。","img":"images/641092/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"放白酒。","img":"images/641092/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"拌匀腌制。","img":"images/641092/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"腌了半天的样子，就完全入味了。","img":"images/641092/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/641092/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"生抽可以换成普通酱油哦。只是生抽的味道更好一些，喜欢吃辣的可以多放点辣椒。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}